@startuml
title PBRで表面へ届く光とカメラへ戻る光
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Yu Gothic UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 24
  BorderColor black
  BackgroundColor #f7fbff
}
rectangle "直接光源\n方向・色・強度・距離" as Direct #fff5df
rectangle "HDR環境\n全方向のradiance" as Env #f4edff
rectangle "表面\n法線・base color\nmetallic・roughness" as Surface #eaf7e8
rectangle "拡散反射\nLambertとenergy配分" as Diffuse
rectangle "鏡面反射\nGGX・Smith・Fresnel" as Specular
rectangle "カメラ\n視線方向" as Camera #fdeaea
Direct --> Surface
Env --> Surface
Surface --> Diffuse
Surface --> Specular
Diffuse --> Camera
Specular --> Camera
Camera --> Surface : 視線方向をBRDFへ渡す
note bottom of Direct
点や方向として近似した光源
形と大きさは影とhighlightへ影響
end note
@enduml
